# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — conan-verify 镜像注入的 .ghfast-bak 回滚缺陷 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-01
# Software: etcd-cpp-apiv3 0.15.4
# Gate: conan-verify G2 / finish W3
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: DRAFT-E323
severity: 3
category: framework|conan-verify
trigger_tool: ohc-run.py
phase: verify
approach: 每次修改 conandata.yml 后运行 conan-verify 前，先删除残留的 conandata.yml.ghfast-bak；G2 失败且报错与上次相同（补丁似乎未应用）时，第一时间 diff conandata.yml 是否被回滚

keywords: ghfast-bak, conandata, 回滚, 恢复, 崩溃残留, 镜像注入, patch not applied, G2

error_signature: 已恢复上次崩溃残留的 conandata\.yml|patches: \{\}|GPR_ASSERT.*undeclared.*复发
match_keywords: ghfast-bak,conandata,恢复,回滚,镜像

root_cause: conan_verify.py G2 的镜像注入逻辑在 finally 中恢复了 conandata.yml 内容但不删除
  .ghfast-bak 备份文件；下次 conan-verify 启动时的"崩溃恢复"逻辑检测到残留 bak 即用它覆盖
  当前 conandata.yml，导致两次验证之间对 conandata 的任何修改（如补丁登记）被静默回滚，
  G2 表现为"补丁未应用"的复发错误
affected_scope: 所有需要在 conan-verify 迭代间修改 conandata.yml 的适配任务；含 W3 前置的
  finish 内嵌 conan-verify 同样受影响

rec_priority: 1
